#{[{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186715337 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186059666 :knowledge-point/title "Finding Exact Values Using the Sum and Difference Formulas" :topic/_knowledge-points [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186048319 :topic/title "The Sum and Difference Formulas for Cosine"}]}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "8d69ea68-5adf-5760-8fd3-7d18ec20d518" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{- \\sqrt{2} + \\sqrt{6}}{4}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186715344} {:answer/id #uuid "3e104402-37e3-45b6-ae08-cd09a73b55a0" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{\\sqrt2}{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186748719}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "8d69ea68-5adf-5760-8fd3-7d18ec20d518" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{- \\sqrt{2} + \\sqrt{6}}{4}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186715344} :answer-field/id #uuid "54cb7999-113e-506b-81be-9adc4fb23923" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186715341}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/hard} :question/id #uuid "31388341-544f-5e6b-8fe8-8155a0101cd5" :question/problem "Find the **exact** value of the expression below.\n\n$$\n\\cos\\left(-345^\\circ\\right)\\cos\\left(60^\\circ\\right)-\\sin\\left(-345^\\circ\\right)\\sin\\left(60^\\circ\\right)\n$$\n\n{{field-1}}" :question/worked-solution "Recognize the sum formula in reverse:\n\n$$\n\\cos x\\cos y-\\sin x\\sin y=\\cos(x+y).\n$$\n\nCombining the angles gives\n\n$$\n\\cos\\left(-345^\\circ+60^\\circ\\right)=\\cos\\left(-285^\\circ\\right).\n$$\n\nChoose a decomposition into special angles:\n\n$$\n-285^\\circ=30^\\circ-315^\\circ.\n$$\n\nRecall the difference formula for cosine:\n\n$$\n\\cos(x-y)=\\cos x\\cos y+\\sin x\\sin y.\n$$\n\nApply it to the decomposition:\n\n$$\n\\cos\\left(-285^\\circ\\right)=\\cos\\left(30^\\circ-315^\\circ\\right).\n$$\n\n$$\n\\cos\\left(30^\\circ\\right)\\cos\\left(315^\\circ\\right)+\\sin\\left(30^\\circ\\right)\\sin\\left(315^\\circ\\right)\n$$\n\nSubstitute the signed special-angle values and combine:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n&=\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}\\cdot \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}+\\frac{1}{2}\\cdot \\left(- \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}\\right) \\\\\n&=\\frac{\\sqrt{6}}{4}+\\left(- \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{4}\\right) \\\\\n&=\\frac{- \\sqrt{2} + \\sqrt{6}}{4}.\n\\end{aligned}\n$$"}]}
